{title: How Great Thou Art}
{artist: Stuart K. Hine}
{key: Bb}

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Bb]O Lord my God, when I in [Eb]awesome wonder
Consider [Bb]all the worlds thy [F]hands have [Bb]made
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_chorus}
Then sings my soul, my [Eb]Saviour God to [Bb]thee
How great thou [F]art, how great thou [Bb]art
{end_of_chorus}
